            <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">a potential delisting of our common stock from trading on the Nasdaq Capital Market if our stockholders&#8217; equity does not meet and maintain the $2.5&#160;million minimum Nasdaq threshold; </font>
          </div>
          <div style="clear:both; padding:0pt; margin:0pt;font-size:0pt;line-height:0pt;">&#8203;</div>
