      </div>
      <div style="margin-top:15.85pt;height:24pt;margin-left:69.66pt;width:456pt;">
        <div style="margin-top:6pt; width:456pt; line-height:14pt;font-size:12pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.24pt;">&#160;</font>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:5.833pt; width:456pt;">
          <div style="margin-left: 0pt; width: 456pt; margin-top: 0pt; font-size: 1pt; line-height: 0pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000; ">&#8203;</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top:6pt;margin-left:69.66pt;width:456pt;">
        <div style="text-align:center; width:456pt; line-height:20pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:18pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:-0.36pt;">C</font><font style="text-transform:lowercase;letter-spacing:-0.36pt;">APITALIZATION</font><font style="font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.36pt;"> </font>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:12pt; text-align:justify; width:456pt; line-height:12pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">The following unaudited table sets forth our cash and our capitalization at June&#160;30, 2023: </font>
        </div>
        <div style=" float:left; margin-left:20pt; line-height:12pt; margin-top:5.9pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:left; width:20pt;white-space:nowrap;">
          <font style="font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif;">&#10146;</font>
          <br >
        </div>
        <div style=" margin-top:5.9pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:12pt; text-align:left; margin-left:40pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">on an actual basis; and </font>
        </div>
        <div style="clear:both; padding:0pt; margin:0pt;font-size:0pt;line-height:0pt;">&#8203;</div>

          <div style="clear:both; padding:0pt; margin:0pt;font-size:0pt;line-height:0pt;">&#8203;</div>
          <div style=" float:left; margin-left:20pt; line-height:12pt; margin-top:5.9pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:justify; width:20pt;white-space:nowrap;">
            <font style="font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif;">&#10146;</font>
            <br >
          </div>
          <div style=" margin-top:5.9pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:12pt; text-align:justify; margin-left:40pt;">
            <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">on an as adjusted basis to give effect to the sale and issuance by us of 8,700,000 shares of our common stock in this offering, at an assumed offering price of $1.15 per share, the last reported sale price of our common stock on the Nasdaq Capital Market on September&#160;7, 2023, after deducting estimated underwriting discounts and commissions and estimated offering expenses payable by us. </font>
