        <div style="margin-top:12pt; text-align:justify; width:456pt; line-height:12pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">The number of shares of common stock to be outstanding after the offering is based on 1,950,674 shares of common stock outstanding as of June&#160;30, 2023, and excludes, as of that date, the following: </font>
        </div>
        <div style=" float:left; margin-left:20pt; line-height:12pt; margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:justify; width:20pt;white-space:nowrap;">
          <font style="font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif;">&#10146;</font>
          <br >
        </div>
        <div style=" margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:12pt; text-align:justify; margin-left:40pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">267,277 shares of common stock issuable upon exercise of outstanding stock options at a weighted average exercise price of $10.84 per share; </font>
        </div>
        <div style="clear:both; padding:0pt; margin:0pt;font-size:0pt;line-height:0pt;">&#8203;</div>
        <div style=" float:left; margin-left:20pt; line-height:12pt; margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:justify; width:20pt;white-space:nowrap;">
          <font style="font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif;">&#10146;</font>
          <br >
        </div>
        <div style=" margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:12pt; text-align:justify; margin-left:40pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">15,625 shares of common stock issuable upon the exercise of outstanding IPO Underwriter Warrants at an exercise price of $100.00 per share;</font>
        </div>
        <div style="clear:both; padding:0pt; margin:0pt;font-size:0pt;line-height:0pt;">&#8203;</div>
        <div style=" float:left; margin-left:20pt; line-height:12pt; margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:justify; width:20pt;white-space:nowrap;">
          <font style="font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif;">&#10146;</font>
